// Initials returns the uppercased first letter of each whitespace-separated
// word in name, concatenated without separators. For example, "ada lovelace"
// yields "AL". Leading and trailing whitespace is ignored, and an empty or
// all-whitespace name yields "".
//
// Initials works on the first byte of each word, so a word that begins with
// a multi-byte UTF-8 character produces an invalid partial rune rather than
// that character's initial.
